        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan backs up the current saves first, so you can go back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan copie d’abord les sauvegardes actuelles, pour que vous puissiez revenir en arrière."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan changes on/off values, numbers and text only": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan ne modifie que les valeurs oui/non, les nombres et le texte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't add %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu ajouter %1$@ : %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't back up the saves: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu copier les sauvegardes : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't make the mod: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu créer le mod : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't move the save to the Trash: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu placer la sauvegarde dans la corbeille : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't read F95Checker's library at %@. Choose the db.sqlite3 in F95Checker's folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu lire la bibliothèque de F95Checker à %@. Choisissez le fichier db.sqlite3 dans le dossier de F95Checker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't restore the saves: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu restaurer les sauvegardes : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't save the library: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu enregistrer la bibliothèque : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't save the report: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu enregistrer le rapport : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't start %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu lancer %1$@ : %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan couldn't use this picture: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan n’a pas pu utiliser cette image : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan deletes its working copy. The game you added and your saves stay where they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan supprime sa copie de travail. Le jeu que vous avez ajouté et vos sauvegardes restent où ils sont."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan downloads it again the next time a game needs it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan le téléchargera de nouveau quand un jeu en aura besoin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan downloads the Ren'Py a game needs from renpy.org the first time you play it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan télécharge depuis renpy.org la version de Ren’Py dont un jeu a besoin la première fois que vous y jouez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan keeps its own copy and turns it on for that game. The game’s own files are never changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan en garde sa propre copie et l’active pour ce jeu. Les fichiers du jeu ne sont jamais modifiés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan makes a mod with a starter script that uses its mod API, turns it on for this game, and opens it in your editor. Changes go in at each launch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan crée un mod avec un script de départ qui utilise son API de mods, l’active pour ce jeu et l’ouvre dans votre éditeur. Vos changements sont pris en compte à chaque lancement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan sur GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan reads the itch.io page or F95zone thread you set on a game and tells you when a newer version is out. Nothing is downloaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan lit la page itch.io ou le fil F95zone que vous avez indiqué pour un jeu et vous avertit quand une version plus récente sort. Rien n’est téléchargé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan unpacks it into its own folder (%@). The zip stays as it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan le décompresse dans son propre dossier (%@). Le zip reste tel quel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan unpacks it into its own folder. The zip stays as it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan le décompresse dans son propre dossier. Le zip reste tel quel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan unpacks the zip into its own folder (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan décompresse le zip dans son propre dossier (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan unpacks the zip into its own folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan décompresse le zip dans son propre dossier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan watches itch.io game pages and F95zone threads, such as https://studio.itch.io/game or https://f95zone.to/threads/game.12345/.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan suit les pages de jeux itch.io et les fils F95zone, comme https://studio.itch.io/game ou https://f95zone.to/threads/game.12345/."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RenChan will keep your Ren'Py visual novels in one place and play any of them on this Mac, even games made only for Windows or Linux, with screen filters and mods that never change the game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RenChan rassemblera vos romans visuels Ren’Py au même endroit et lancera n’importe lequel sur ce Mac, même les jeux conçus uniquement pour Windows ou Linux, avec des filtres d’écran et des mods qui ne modifient jamais le jeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
